<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $60-1/8 (FIM 301.80).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $60-1/8 (FIM 301.80).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-1/2 at $60-1/8 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 301.80 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed 1.50 markka lower at 309.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) ended up $0-1/2 at $37-3/4 in New York on Thursday. The price equals about 94.75 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki, Valmet closed down two markka at 93.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended flat at to $22-5/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 113.80 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Rauma closed down one markka at 113.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
